o not use for generic app/software tasks that merely mention Codex.","shortDescription":"Codex models/pricing, scheduled tasks, skills, settings, setup, troubleshooting, and self-knowledge; OpenAI APIs and ChatGPT Work. 'You'/'this app' means Codex only.","interface":{"displayName":"OpenAI Docs","shortDescription":"OpenAI and Codex docs for models, skills, tasks, and setup","iconSmall":"C:\\Users\\pjhud\\.codex\\skills\\.system\\openai-docs\\assets\\openai-small.svg","iconLarge":"C:\\Users\\pjhud\\.codex\\skills\\.system\\openai-docs\\assets\\openai.png","iconSmallUrl":null,"iconLargeUrl":null,"brandColor":null,"defaultPrompt":"Use OpenAI Docs for official docs lookup, questions about Codex itself or Codex surfaces, model selection, model migration, and prompt-upgrade work."},"path":"C:\\Users\\pjhud\\.codex\\skills\\.system\\openai-docs\\SKILL.md","scope":"system","enabled":true,"pluginId":null},{"name":"plugin-creator","description":"Create and scaffold plugin directories for Codex with a required `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`, optional plugin folders/files, valid manifest defaults, and personal-marketplace entries by default. Use when Codex needs to create a new personal plugin, add optional plugin structure, generate or update marketplace entries for plugin ordering and availability metadata, or update an existing local plugin during development with the CLI-driven cachebuster and reinstall flow.","interface":{"displayName":"Plugin Creator","shortDescription":"Scaffold plugins and marketplace entries","iconSmall":"C:\\Users\\pjhud\\.codex\\skills\\.system\\plugin-creator\\assets\\plugin-creator-small.svg","iconLarge":"C:\\Users\\pjhud\\.codex\\skills\\.system\\plugin-creator\\assets\\plugin-creator.png","iconSmallUrl":null,"iconLargeUrl":null,"brandColor":null,"defaultPrompt":"Use $plugin-creator to scaffold a valid plugin in the personal marketplace, then validate it before handing it back."},"path":"C:\\Users\\pjhud\\.codex\\skills\\.system\\plugin-creator\\SKIL